      "claim_boundary": "The verify package implements a strict A2A v1.0 Message-extension presentation with a pinned Ed25519 binder, exact Task/context/message/Agent Card/receipt/action commitments, and fail-closed substitution tests. A2A server authentication, receipt verification, local authorization, external project adoption, and independent interoperability remain separate and are not claimed."
